 Welcome to postctl.                                                           
                                                                               
 No collections yet. Start with a request, or bring in your Postman data:      
                                                                               
 › Create a request              Enter                                         
   Import from the Postman app   postctl import postman-local                  
   Import a Postman export       postctl import postman <file.json>            
                                                                               
 Everything is stored as plain files in /tmp/postctl-test/payments-api, so it  
 works with git.                                                               
                                                                               
                                                                               
                                                                               
                                                                               
                                                                               
                                                                               
                                                                               
                                                                               
                                                                               
